HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: DUAL-POD STERN THRUST ALLOCATION SUBSYSTEM
BTW Decomposes surge, sway, and yaw commands into pod setpoints
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A POD_ARM_M ITZ 1.6

HOW IZ I ALLOCATE_PODS YR SURGE_N AN YR MOMENT_NM
    I HAS A BASE ITZ QUOSHUNT OF SURGE_N AN 2.0
    I HAS A DIFF ITZ QUOSHUNT OF MOMENT_NM AN PRODUKT OF 2.0 AN POD_ARM_M
    FOUND YR SUM OF BASE AN DIFF
IF U SAY SO

